            ECHO OF THE FIRST FEW INPUT CARDS -
 INPUT CARD>!   As atom...Test of relativistic energy correction,                           
 INPUT CARD>!   by the Douglas-Kroll transformation to 3rd order.                           
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   The best scalar relativistic treatment is LUT-IOTC,                         
 INPUT CARD>!   which exploits atomic distance separation for                               
 INPUT CARD>!   speed, but the Local Unitary Transformation form                            
 INPUT CARD>!   is equivalent to full IOTC in the case of an atom.                          
 INPUT CARD>!   Relativity runs would normally use RELWFN=LUT-IOTC.                         
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   the FINAL DK3 energy is -2259.0955125948                                    
 INPUT CARD>!   web page says           -2259.095511826                                     
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   convergence of the DK transformation is typical,                            
 INPUT CARD>!      0th order -2234.2372862734  (non-relativistic)                           
 INPUT CARD>!      1st order -2264.6131859581                                               
 INPUT CARD>!      2nd order -2258.9450224748                                               
 INPUT CARD>!      3rd order -2259.0955125948                                               
 INPUT CARD>!     inf. order -2259.0876052750                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   in that 1st order way undershoots, 2nd order comes                          
 INPUT CARD>!   back close, and 3rd order is not insubstantial.                             
 INPUT CARD>!   DK3 AO radii are <r(4s)>=1.997, <r(4p)>=2.504 Bohr,                         
 INPUT CARD>!   compared to 2.0292 and 2.5112 for non-relativistic.                         
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   Compare with -2259.456841 which is the point                                
 INPUT CARD>!   nucleus Dirac-Coulomb numerical Hartree-Fock from                           
 INPUT CARD>!             L.Visscher, K.G.Dyall                                             
 INPUT CARD>!     At.Data Nucl.Data Tables 67, 207-224(1997),                               
 INPUT CARD>!   noting that the present run does not include any                            
 INPUT CARD>!   relativistic treatment of the 2e- potential.                                
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   The uncontracted 20s15p9d basis set below is from                           
 INPUT CARD>!       T.Tsuchiya, M.Abe, T.Nakajima, K.Hirao                                  
 INPUT CARD>!          J.Chem.Phys. 115, 4463-4472(2001)                                    
 INPUT CARD>!   See the GAMESS manual about other basis sets, or                            
 INPUT CARD>!   how to generally contract the University of Tokyo                           
 INPUT CARD>!   basis sets, with ~/gamess/tools/dk3.f.                                      
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>!   The semicolon divides two lines of input that happen                        
 INPUT CARD>!   to be given on a single physical line of the file.                          
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD> $contrl scftyp=rohf mult=4 relwfn=dk ispher=1 $end                             
 INPUT CARD> $system timlim=2 mwords=2 $end                                                 
 INPUT CARD> $relwfn norder=3 $end                                                          
 INPUT CARD> $guess  guess=huckel $end                                                      
 INPUT CARD> $radial nshell=2 idegsh(1)=1,3 memsh(1)=15, 16,17,18 $end                      
 INPUT CARD> $data                                                                          
 INPUT CARD>illustration of 3rd order Douglas-Kroll for As                                  
 INPUT CARD>Dnh 2                                                                           
 INPUT CARD>                                                                                
